      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Impressed by Max's work at the stove, Aleksandr invites him into the office for a mid-shift drink and asks where he learned to cook. After joking that Max should have dodged the army too, the new chef starts asking which women at Claude Monet are single.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Спасибо, шеф.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Ты где готовить учился?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
